OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FInvestigations into the cause of the
OL,7,FEast Sussex train derailment, on what
OL,8,Fwas the hottest day of the year so
OL,9,Ffar, are continuing, as ITV News' Amy
OL,10,FLewis reports
OL,12,FA Network Rail chief has said
OL,13,Finvestigations will "look at all
OL,14,Fpossible causes and factors" after two
OL,15,Ftrain derailments in two days, adding
OL,16,Fthat the recent hot weather had posed
OL,17,F"exceptional challenges" for the
OL,18,Frailway network.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
