OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FThe announcement comes after a second
OL,7,Ftrain derailed less than 24 hours
OL,8,Fafter two passengers were seriously
OL,9,Finjured when a Southern Rail service
OL,10,Fcame off the tracks in East Sussex.
OL,12,FA Greater Anglia train derailed at
OL,13,F2.12pm on Friday south of Wickford
OL,14,Frailway station in Essex, British
OL,15,FTransport Police said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FBTP said officers, paramedics and
OL,7,Ffirefighters are at the scene after
OL,8,Freports that the rear carriages of the
OL,9,Ftrain have derailed in an upright
OL,10,Fposition. No injuries have currently
OL,11,Fbeen reported.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FMartin Frobisher, group safety and
OL,7,Fengineering director at Network Rail,
OL,8,Fsaid: "I appreciate the public will be
OL,9,Fconcerned at the news of two
OL,10,Fderailments of passenger trains over a
OL,11,Fshort period of time, but I want to
OL,12,Freassure them that Britain's railways
OL,13,Fstill rank among the safest in the
OL,14,Fworld, and that safety is always our
OL,15,Ffirst consideration on the railway."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FMr Frobisher said that the Rail
OL,7,FAccident Investigation Branch is
OL,8,Fconducting an investigation into the
OL,9,Fincident in Lewes and has
OL,10,Finvestigators on scene in Wickford.
OL,11,FNetwork Rail will also conduct their
OL,12,Fown investigation to "look at all
OL,13,Fpossible causes and factors".
OL,15,F"The unprecedented hot and dry weather
OL,16,Fthat we have experienced this summer
OL,17,Fhas presented exceptional challenges
OL,18,Fto the railway," he added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,F"In response, we have taken several
OL,7,Fadditional proactive steps to manage
OL,8,Fand mitigate the impact on the
OL,9,Frailway, including closely monitoring
OL,10,Fthe temperature of tracks,
OL,11,Fimplementing speed restrictions where
OL,12,Fit is appropriate to do so, and
OL,13,Fplanning track renewals around high
OL,14,Ftemperatures.
OL,16,F"Our continued focus remains on
OL,17,Fsupporting those affected by these
OL,18,Fincidents, working at pace to
OL,19,Funderstand the causes, and doing all
OL,20,Fwe can to get services back running
OL,21,Fsafely as quickly as possible."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FMr Frobisher also thanked teams from
OL,7,Facross the rail industry and the
OL,8,Femergency services for "working around
OL,9,Fthe clock" and asked people to "avoid
OL,10,Fspeculating on the cause" until
OL,11,Ffurther information is available.
OL,13,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,14,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,15,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,16,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/12
