OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FA major incident was declared by BTP
OL,7,Fin East Sussex when three carriages of
OL,8,Fa Southern train ended up on their
OL,9,Fside, trapping passengers near Lewes
OL,10,Fon Thursday afternoon.
OL,12,FAround 150 people had been on board
OL,13,Fthe service from London Victoria to
OL,14,FEastbourne.
OL,16,FTwo people were taken to major trauma
OL,17,Fcentres with "severe" injuries, and
OL,18,FBTP said on Friday these were not
OL,19,Fdeemed to be life-threatening.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
