PN,31309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FLater on Friday, an East of England
OL,7,FAmbulance Service spokesperson said
OL,8,Fthey were called just after 2.10pm on
OL,9,FFriday to the scene in Wickford and
OL,10,Fdispatched a "significant number of
OL,11,Fresources" to the scene, including a
OL,12,Fspecialist Hazardous Area Response
OL,13,FTeam and critical care teams from
OL,14,Fcharity partners, including two air
OL,15,Fambulances.
OL,17,FCrews assessed 62 patients who were on
OL,18,Fboard the train, all of whom were
OL,19,Fdischarged at the scene.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FNo trains between Wickford and
OL,7,FSouthend Victoria are expected until
OL,8,Fat least the end of Friday, National
OL,9,FRail said on its website.
OL,11,FPolice presence in Lewes
OL,13,FAssistant Chief Constable Ian Drummond-
OL,14,FSmith said of the East Sussex
OL,15,Fincident: "Our thoughts remain firmly
OL,16,Fwith those who were injured and their
OL,17,Floved ones. On behalf of BTP, I wish
OL,18,Fthem a full and speedy recovery."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FThe force is appealing for anyone on
OL,7,Fboard the derailed train who has not
OL,8,Falready spoken to police to come
OL,9,Fforward.
OL,11,FOfficers said many passengers left the
OL,12,Farea and took alternative routes home
OL,13,Fafter they were evacuated.
OL,15,FMr Drummond-Smith said the public can
OL,16,Fexpect to see a "continued police
OL,17,Fpresence" at the scene in the coming
OL,18,Fdays as the RAIB's investigation into
OL,19,Fthe cause continues.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
