OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786760289
OL,3,CInvestigation launched after two train
OL,4,Cderailments in 24 hours
OL,6,FThe senior officer also paid tribute
OL,7,Fto communities and emergency services
OL,8,Fwho responded to the derailment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/12
